      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "What time is it, and who's going out with you?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-16T21:54:54.452931+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Hi! Just wondering what time you're free for today.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-16T21:55:42.019964+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Why do you have to know my free time?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-16T21:56:04.254491+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Sure! My free time is pretty busy, but I could probably pick you up around 2 pm. What about you? Any plans for the evening?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-16T21:56:35.229366+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Oh, I'm sorry, that's too bad. I wasn't sure if you were busy for dinner.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-16T21:58:10.104343+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Oh, I'm sorry, that's too bad. It must have been hard to plan things around your schedule, especially for dinner! Let me know what works best for you when we go out.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-16T21:59:43.545668+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "I understand that planning a dinner date can be challenging. Would you like me to book a table for us?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-16T22:03:02.061241+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Sure, I'd be happy to book a table for us.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-16T22:04:15.457646+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "That sounds great, I can look it up right now. Is there a certain time you would like the reservation to be made?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-16T22:08:55.396518+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Perfect, thanks! I can book a table for us at 2 pm. Let me know the reservation details and any special instructions.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-16T22:10:18.049729+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Thank you so much for the offer!",
      "created_at": "2026-09-16T22:12:57.062373+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Thanks a lot for the offer! I'm happy to make the reservation!",
      "created_at": "2026-09-16T22:14:20.363241+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Thanks a lot for the offer!",
      "created_at": "2026-09-16T22:15:40.973815+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Thanks a lot for the offer! It was a pleasure to meet you.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-16T22:17:06.462203+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Thank you very much! I appreciate that offer.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-16T22:18:28.152771+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "I'm glad to hear you find my services useful. How about I treat you to some delicious food and a cozy setting at my place? We can set up a reservation for when you arrive.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-16T22:23:22.275321+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "I appreciate your offer! What kind of food and a cozy setting would you recommend? Also, when can we make the reservation?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-16T22:24:48.318599+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Sure, I\u2019d love to book a table for us. What kind of food and a cozy setting do you prefer? Also, when would you like the reservation made?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-16T22:32:11.374959+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "That sounds great! I can look it up right now. What is your preferred type of food and seating arrangement? Also, when would you prefer to make the reservation?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-16T22:43:03.562464+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "How about we start with a Mediterranean-style dinner? I've got a lot of great places in town that serve authentic flavors. Plus, if you have any dietary preferences or restrictions, I can definitely accommodate them.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-16T22:46:58.629563+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "What type of food do you recommend for the reservation?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-16T22:48:44.455757+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "For the reservation, I'll consider a Mediterranean-style dinner! How about a romantic dinner in an elegant setting with fine wines and candlelight? Do you prefer wine or red wine?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-16T22:52:00.676453+00:00"
    }
